        {
          "resource_id": "monster_trait",
          "stats": {
            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Starvation Aura"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "(aura, divine, mental, necromancy)\n\n60 feet. Any creature that ends its turn in the aura feels the intense pain of starvation and must attempt a 30 Fortitude save. On a failure, the creature becomes fatigued and takes 6d6 damage. Damage and fatigue a creature takes from this aura can't be healed until the affected creature has eaten a full meal."
            },
